  "title": "Qt: Display IO Graphs and Plots that fail validation",
  "description": "The IO Graphs and Plots validate that Y fields are valid registered\nfields. Sometimes field abbreviations change between releases.\n\nuat_load returns failure and an error if a record fails validation,\nbut still can add it in that case. It makes more sense to display\nthe record which failed validation in the GUI so that the user can\ntry to fix it rather than clear all records.\n\nFix #20788",
